-- Cosmetic and visual modules only.
--
-- Controls:
--   Left-click a module  = toggle it
--   Right-click a module = open its settings (modules with a "+" have settings)
--   Drag a panel header  = move that panel
--   Menu key (default RightShift) = show/hide the menu (rebind it in the Client panel)
